# Purpose: Forward appended log records with one handler invocation per record.
# Input: events.log in the calling directory; create it before launching.
# Output: Each new UTF-8 log line on stdout. Ctrl-C stops and reaps owned tools.
accept path as text with default "events.log"
listen to "tail" with arguments ["-n", "0", "-F", path]
whenever a line arrives as event
  then "cat"
